    "description": "LlamaBlocks is a complex, multi-year long development, MCreator mod which adds a ton of features. These include 702 variants of custom building blocks, the complex Computer block with a calculator and much more, a password system for improved game-immersion, many custom storage items, a custom Banana farming item with some cool gimmicks, a custom damaging fluid named Acid, and more!"
